={{ JSON.stringify({
  model: "llama-3.3-70b-versatile",
  temperature: 0,
  response_format: { type: "json_object" },
  messages: [{
    role: "user",
    content: `You are a LeadStrategus prospect qualification agent for client Sharp SSDI.

Objective: find people who influence ERP decisions, Document Management Systems, Digital Transformation, workflow automation, and IT modernization at their company.

Persona tiers (use for the 'priority' field):
Tier 1 — CIO, CTO, Head of IT, IT Director: direct ownership of technology decisions.
Tier 2 — COO, Head of Operations, Digital Transformation Head: own operational improvement initiatives.
Tier 3 — CFO, Finance Head: relevant for ERP approval workflows and compliance.
Avoid — Software Engineers, Developers, IT Support Engineers, System Administrators, Junior Managers: do not prioritize.

Title-relevance score anchors (use these as reference points for the 'score' field, 1-100):
CIO: 95+
IT Head / Head of IT / CTO / IT Director: 90+
IT Manager: 70-80
COO / Head of Operations / Digital Transformation Head: 60-85
CFO / Finance Head: 30-55
Engineer / Developer / IT Support / SysAdmin / Junior Manager: below 40

Company context — also weigh these when available and adjust the score/reason accordingly (if unavailable, note 'Unknown' in the reason rather than guessing):
- Company size: ${$json.companySize || 'Unknown'}
- Industry: ${$json.industry || 'Unknown'}
- Existing technology maturity / transformation signals: infer from title and company context if no explicit signal is provided.

Candidate:
Name: ${$json.fullName || $json.name}
Title: ${$json.job || $json.title}
Profile: ${$json.profileUrl}
Company: ${$json.company}

Return ONLY valid JSON with these exact keys: {"score": number, "seniority": "C-Suite|VP|Director|Manager|Other", "priority": "Tier 1|Tier 2|Tier 3|Skip", "reason": string}`
  }]
}) }}

parameters.jsCode:
const groqText = $json.choices[0].message.content;
let parsed;
try {
  parsed = JSON.parse(groqText);
} catch (e) {
  parsed = { score: 0, seniority: 'Other', priority: 'Skip', reason: 'Could not parse LLM response' };
}
const candidate = $('Split Out Candidates').item.json;
return [{
  json: {
    Company: candidate.company,
    Name: candidate.fullName || candidate.name,
    Designation: candidate.job || candidate.title,
    Seniority: parsed.seniority,
    LinkedInURL: candidate.profileUrl,
    Score: parsed.score,
    Priority: parsed.priority,
    Reason: parsed.reason,
    Activity: candidate.lastActivity || 'Unknown',
    Status: parsed.score >= 70 ? 'Auto-Approved' : 'Needs Review'
  }
}];
